text>isu</text><chinese>是你</chinese></item><count>10</count></custom><song><count>0</count></song><picture><count>0</count></picture><read><count>0</count></read><culture><item><text>“pucing, parih, bkaruh, towkan ni bhniq, isu do emptealax su paah rudan ka isu da, mha su emburux nanak smalu sapah, qngqaya bgay mu sunan nii o kika djiyun su qmeepah danga su ruwan sapah”.</text><chinese>番刀、鋤頭、大鋤頭、揹袋及弓箭，你要離開父母親，要獨立成家立業，給你的這些器具要使用在工作上養育你的家庭。</chinese><lesson>6</lesson><type>sentence</type><order>8</order><url>https://web.klokah.tw/extension/cu_practice/index.php?d=33&amp;l=6&amp;view=article</url></item><item><text>yaasa wana pnskraya ptasan dqras o kika klaun utux rudan gaga mhiyug siyaw Hakaw Utux hiya qmita sunan do isu o kingal bi pusu rudan, deita nanak.</text><chinese>因為只有藉著文面的印記，站在通往靈魂橋邊的祖靈才會認得你是同一族的子孫。</chinese><lesson>29</lesson><type>sentence</type><order>9</order><url>https://web.klokah.tw/extension/cu_practice/index.php?d=33&amp;l=29&amp;view=article</url></item><item><text>“Isu o empburux su ka isu da, nii o qaya cinun, mha su tminun qabang ni lklukus, hilaw su ruwan sapah mtaqi keeman”.</text><chinese>你要獨立自主，這個是織布機，你要去織毯子及一些衣服，供家人晚上蓋被睡覺。</chinese><lesson>6</lesson><type>sentence</type><order>10</order><url>https://web.klokah.tw/extension/cu_practice/index.php?d=33&amp;l=6&amp;view=article</url></item><count>3</count></culture><dialogue><item><text>Ima su ka isu hug?</text><chinese>A:你是誰?</chinese><lesson>2</lesson><season>1</season><order>1</order><url>https://web.klokah.tw/dialogue/index.php?d=33&amp;theme=2&amp;season=1</url></item><item><text>Ima su ka isu?</text><chinese>A:你是誰?</chinese><lesson>2</lesson><season>1</season><order>3</order><url>https://web.klokah.tw/dialogue/index.php?d=33&amp;theme=2&amp;season=1</url></item><item><text>Ima su ka isu hug?</text><chinese>A:你是誰?</chinese><lesson>2</lesson><season>1</season><order>5</order><url>https://web.klokah.tw/dialogue/index.php?d=33&amp;theme=2&amp;season=1</url></item><item><text>Piya mnswayi su ka isu?</text><chinese>A:你有幾個兄弟姊妹?</chinese><lesson>2</lesson><season>1</season><order>30</order><url>https://web.klokah.tw/dialogue/index.php?d=33&amp;theme=2&amp;season=1</url></item><item><text>Niqan qbsuran su snaw ka isu hug?</text><chinese>A:你有哥哥嗎?</chinese><lesson>2</lesson><season>1</season><order>32</order><url>https://web.klokah.tw/dialogue/index.php?d=33&amp;theme=2&amp;season=1</url></item><item><text>Seejiq su Tmpusu ka isu hug?</text><chinese>A:你是原住民嗎?</chinese><lesson>3</lesson><season>1</season><order>11</order><url>https://web.klokah.tw/dialogue/index.php?d=33&amp;theme=3&amp;season=1</url></item><item><text>Mseupu su mniq tama ni bubu su ka isu hug?</text><chinese>A:你和爸爸媽媽一起住嗎?</chinese><lesson>3</lesson><season>1</season><order>23</order><url>https://web.klokah.tw/dialogue/index.php?d=33&amp;theme=3&amp;season=1</url></item><item><text>Mseupu su tghuy ima ka isu?</text><chinese>A:你和誰一起住?</chinese><lesson>3</lesson><season>1</season><order>27</order><url>https://web.klokah.tw/dialogue/index.php?d=33&amp;theme=3&amp;season=1</url></item><item><text>Ima su ka isu hug?</text><chinese>A:請問哪位?</chinese><lesson>6</lesson><season>1</season><order>7</order><url>https://web.klokah.tw/dialogue/index.php?d=33&amp;theme=6&amp;season=1</url></item><item><text>Ququ mkan, aji su seejiq isil ka isu.</text><chinese>A:盡量吃喝，你又不是外人。</chinese><lesson>6</lesson><season>1</season><order>21</order><url>https://web.klokah.tw/dialogue/index.php?d=33&amp;theme=6&amp;season=1</url></item><item><text>Usa mlaq qsiya ka isu.</text><chinese>A:你去澆水。</chinese><lesson>7</lesson><season>1</season><order>13</order><url>https://web.klokah.tw/dialogue/index.php?d=33&amp;theme=7&amp;season=1</url></item><item><text>Usa mangal kraji liwaq qbhni ka isu.</text><chinese>A:你去拿趕鳥器。</chinese><lesson>7</lesson><season>1</season><order>15</order><url>https://web.klokah.tw/dialogue/index.php?d=33&amp;theme=7&amp;season=1</url></item><item><text>Ini huya, asi usa qmita qbhni ka isu da.</text><chinese>A:沒關係，那你去看鳥。</chinese><lesson>7</lesson><season>1</season><order>24</order><url>https://web.klokah.tw/dialogue/index.php?d=33&amp;theme=7&amp;season=1</url></item><item><text>Mnmanu klgan kari klaan su rmngaw ka isu?</text><chinese>A:您會說哪些語言?</chinese><lesson>9</lesson><season>1</season><order>21</order><url>https://web.klokah.tw/dialogue/index.php?d=33&amp;theme=9&amp;season=1</url></item><item><text>Ima su ka isu?</text><chinese>A:你是誰?</chinese><lesson>2</lesson><season>2</season><order>9</order><url>https://web.klokah.tw/dialogue/index.php?d=33&amp;theme=2&amp;season=2</url></item><item><text>Ima su ka isu?</text><chinese>A:你是誰?</chinese><lesson>2</lesson><season>2</season><order>11</order><url>https://web.klokah.tw/dialogue/index.php?d=33&amp;theme=2&amp;season=2</url></item><item><text>Isu o Samaw hug?</text><chinese>A:你是Samaw嗎?</chinese><lesson>2</lesson><season>2</season><order>19</order><url>https://web.klokah.tw/dialogue/index.php?d=33&amp;theme=2&amp;season=2</url></item><item><text>Alay musa ka isu, yahun misu miing kiya da.</text><chinese>B:你先去，我等一下去找你。</chinese><lesson>5</lesson><season>2</season><order>16</order><url>https://web.klokah.tw/dialogue/index.php?d=33&amp;theme=5&amp;season=2</url></item><item><text>Isu nanak ka mniq hini?</text><chinese>M:那你自己一個人住嗎?</chinese><lesson>9</lesson><season>2</season><order>21</order><url>https://web.klokah.tw/dialogue/index.php?d=33&amp;theme=9&amp;season=2</url></item><item><text>Usa sangay knrikit ka isu.</text><chinese>B:你趴著休息。</chinese><lesson>1</lesson><season>3</season><order>15</order><url>https://web.klokah.tw/dialogue/index.php?d=33&amp;theme=1&amp;season=3</url></item><item><text>Laqi su tnpusu seejiq tgima ka isu hug?</text><chinese>A:你是哪一族的小孩?</chinese><lesson>2</lesson><season>3</season><order>5</order><url>https://web.klokah.tw/dialogue/index.php?d=33&amp;theme=2&amp;season=3</url></item><item><text>Laqi su ima ka isu hug?</text><chinese>A:你是誰的小孩?</chinese><lesson>2</lesson><season>3</season><order>11</order><url>https://web.klokah.tw/dialogue/index.php?d=33&amp;theme=2&amp;season=3</url></item><item><text>Mosa ku marig uqun ska hidaw han, mha ku miing isu kiya.</text><chinese>B:我先去買午餐，等一下去找你。</chinese><lesson>5</lesson><season>3</season><order>10</order><url>https://web.klokah.tw/dialogue/index.php?d=33&amp;theme=5&amp;season=3</url></item><item><text>Iyah jiyax Mgay Bari ka isu da.</text><chinese>W: 那你感恩祭的時候來吧!</chinese><lesson>9</lesson><season>3</season><order>7</order><url>https://web.klokah.tw/dialogue/index.php?d=33&amp;theme=9&amp;season=3</url></item><count>24</count></dialogue><essay><item><text>Smiyuk hyaan ka tnhiyan na. Yasa ini su bi adas nanak ka isu, duri ni knsyukan su ka qaya o ini su bqaani!</text><chinese>同學告訴他，因為你都不自己帶，而且借給你的東西，你都不會還!</chinese><lesson>11</lesson><season>1</season><order>10</order><url>https://web.klokah.tw/essay/index.php?d=33&amp;theme=11&amp;season=1&amp;page=10</url></item><count>1</count></essay><readingtext><count>0</count></readingtext></dataroot>